                                    <path d="M54.4206 6.49995L44.5806 12.1799V8.56995L48.1706 6.49995L44.5806 4.42995V0.819946L54.4206 6.49995Z" />
                                </g>
                            </svg>
                        </h5>


                        <div class="about-two__about-box">
                            <div class="about-two__about-box__top">
                                <div class="about-two__about-box__icon"><span class="icon-logical-thinking"></span></div>
                                <h4 class="about-two__about-box__title">VISION</h4>
                            </div>
                            <p class="about-two__about-box__text">
                                To redefine professional education by nurturing intellectual excellence, personal growth, and ethical values — empowering every student to become a confident, competent, and compassionate professional who contributes meaningfully to society.
                            </p>
                        </div><!-- /.icon-box -->
                        <div class="about-two__about-box">
                            <div class="about-two__about-box__top">
                                <div class="about-two__about-box__icon"><span class="icon-vision"></span></div>
                                <h4 class="about-two__about-box__title">MISSION</h4>
                            </div>
                            <p class="about-two__about-box__text">
                                At Excel, we aim to make learning meaningful, engaging, and empowering. We deliver quality education through modern and student-centered teaching, foster a supportive environment that builds confidence and curiosity, and equip every student with the knowledge, skills, and values to achieve academic excellence and professional success
                            </p>
                        </div><!-- /.icon-box -->



                        <h3 class="section-title__title">
                            ABOUT US
                        </h3>
                    </div><!-- section-title -->
                    <p class="about-two__content__text">
                        Founded in 2007 by visionary Chartered Accountants — CA. B.L. Agrawal, CA. Praveen Golchha, and CA. Sanjay Kumar Goyal — Excel Educational Institute began with a mission to transform potential into performance and education into empowerment.
                        Over the years, Excel has grown from a single classroom to a powerful educational network with 20+ Classroom, 15 elite faculties, and a thriving student base of 3,000+ learners annually, offering comprehensive coaching for CA, CS, CMA, and Classes 11th & 12th.
                        With over 16,500 success stories and 166 All India Rank holders, Excel has become synonymous with quality, commitment, and achievement. At Excel, we believe that “the great aim of education is not knowledge but action.”
                        We achieve this by, blending academic excellence, holistic development, and ethical values to prepare confident and competent professionals who soar to new heights.

                    </p>

                </div><!-- about content end -->
            </div>
            <div class="col-xl-6 wow fadeInRight" data-wow-delay="100ms" style="margin-top: 100px;">
                <div class="about-three__thumb">
                    <!-- about thumb start -->
                    <div class="about-three__thumb__one eduact-tilt" data-tilt-options='{ "glare": false, "maxGlare": 0, "maxTilt": 2, "speed": 700, "scale": 1 }'>
                        <img src="../../Content/home/images/EXCEL BLD.jpg" alt="eduact" style="width: 461px; height:559px; ">
                    </div><!-- /.about-thumb-one -->
                    <div class="about-three__thumb__shape-one"></div><!-- /.about-shape-one -->
                    <div class="about-three__thumb__shape-two"></div><!-- /.about-shape-two -->
                    <div class="about-three__thumb__shape-three"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><!-- /.about-shape-three -->
                    <div class="about-three__thumb__shape-four"><img src="../../Content/home/images/shapes/about-3-shape-1.png" alt="eduact" /></div><!-- /.about-shape-four -->
                    <div class="about-three__thumb__shape-five"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><!-- /.about-shape-five -->
                    <div class="about-three__thumb__shape-six"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><!-- /.about-shape-six -->
